      "page": 339,
      "ruku": 292,
      "hizbQuarter": 135,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2654,
      "text": "He will surely admit them to a place that they will be pleased with, and Allah is surely All-Knowing, Most Forbearing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 59,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 339,
      "ruku": 292,
      "hizbQuarter": 135,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2655,
      "text": "That is[30] so. Whoever retaliates against an aggressive act with its like and is wronged again, Allah will surely help him. Indeed, Allah is Ever-Pardoning, All-Forgiving[31].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 339,
      "ruku": 292,
      "hizbQuarter": 136,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2656,
      "text": "That is[32] because it is Allah Who causes the night to merge into the day, and causes the day to merge into the night. And Allah is All-Hearing, All-Seeing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 61,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 339,
      "ruku": 292,
      "hizbQuarter": 136,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2657,
      "text": "That is[33] because it is Allah Who is the Truth and whatever they invoke besides Him is falsehood, and it is Allah Who is the Most High, the Most Great.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 339,
      "ruku": 292,
      "hizbQuarter": 136,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2658,
      "text": "Do you not see that Allah sends down rain from the sky whereupon the earth becomes green? Indeed, Allah is Most Subtle, All-Aware[34].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
